  "sourceUse": "Appendix I Article 2 and the September 2026 catalogue match the 60+60+60 EC Dutch route. 760008 and 441082 appear in two blocks at 3 EC each, and the project and thesis each appear in two blocks at 6 EC each. Each is one full course, not duplicate credit. The optional-minor catalogue placeholders sum to 18 EC and do not specify subject content. The programme page illustrates exchange or a specialisation minor; Appendix I expressly allows a minor, free electives or a combination, at home or abroad.",
